window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Despite my last name being Kingsley, I had to work hard for my crown. I’m a gifted hockey player, but earning a spot in the Hannaford U hockey team took more than talent.<br> <br> When it comes to dating, that’s a different story. I’ve always had it easy. There’s never been a girl that I couldn’t win over.<br> <br> Until I met Gia Mancini, a goddess among mortals. Not only did my charms not work on her, she friend-zoned me.<br> <br> But our story isn’t over yet. She messed up, and the only way she can fix her mistake is by agreeing to fake date me.<br> <br> Now the game is on, and I’m not opposed to playing it dirty.</p>"; 
